          "after": "Assume the Axiom of Countable Choice. Let $D_+(T_{2,3},2)$ be the positive-clasped Whitehead double of the right-handed trefoil with Hedden–Ording twist parameter $t=2$. The normalized knot Floer threshold and Rasmussen invariant satisfy\n$$\\tau(D_+(T_{2,3},2))=0,\\qquad s(D_+(T_{2,3},2))=2.$$"
